{"id":"79b2facb-7a1a-49f7-9a00-b3891d875081","revision":0,"last_node_id":62,"last_link_id":152,"nodes":[{"id":33,"type":"SaveImage","pos":[1500,4830],"size":[800,780],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"图片","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":128},{"localized_name":"文件名前缀","name":"filename_prefix","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"filename_prefix"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","links":null}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.25.0","Node name for S&R":"SaveImage"},"widgets_values":["图片/Boogu-image/Boohu-文生图"],"widgets_values_named":{"filename_prefix":"图片/Boogu-image/Boohu-文生图"},"color":"#223","bgcolor":"#335"},{"id":53,"type":"XB_CanvasLabel","pos":[270,4460],"size":[2063,244],"flags":{"allow_interaction":false,"pinned":true},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Boogu-image 文生图","properties":{"cnr_id":"XB_ToolBox","ver":"","Node name for S&R":"XB_CanvasLabel","fontSize":221,"fontColor":"#ffffff","textAlign":"left","backgroundColor":"transparent","padding":0,"borderRadius":0,"angle":0,"aux_id":"wjluoxiao/XB_ToolBox"},"widgets_values":[""],"widgets_values_named":{"xb_label_view":""},"color":"transparent","bgcolor":"transparent"},{"id":54,"type":"XB_CanvasLabel","pos":[1590,4710],"size":[727,53],"flags":{"allow_interaction":false,"pinned":true},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"更多教程全网搜：机智罗_LX","properties":{"cnr_id":"XB_ToolBox","ver":"91f7a7e585e71f49bb9005e8ea4b0c8e3b8d518e","Node name for S&R":"XB_CanvasLabel","fontSize":55,"fontColor":"#ffffff","textAlign":"left","backgroundColor":"transparent","padding":0,"borderRadius":0,"angle":0,"aux_id":"wjluoxiao/XB_ToolBox"},"widgets_values":[""],"widgets_values_named":{"xb_label_view":""},"color":"transparent","bgcolor":"transparent"},{"id":58,"type":"XB_ImagePromptPreset","pos":[300,4830],"size":[600,780],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"Latent 类型","name":"latent_kind","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"latent_kind"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"输出语言","name":"output_lang","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"output_lang"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"预设模式","name":"preset_mode","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"preset_mode"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"预设句","name":"three_view_text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"three_view_text"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"画幅比例","name":"aspect_ratio","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"aspect_ratio"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"宽度","name":"width","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"width"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"高度","name":"height","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"height"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"批量大小","name":"batch_size","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"batch_size"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"提示词","name":"提示词","type":"STRING","links":[126]},{"localized_name":"空 Latent","name":"空latent","type":"LATENT","links":[127]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"XB_ToolBox","ver":"79a90d37644cc416b9218dffe1b4a416a1b21fbd","Node name for S&R":"XB_ImagePromptPreset"},"widgets_values":["Boogu","中文 [ZH]","无预设","","1:1",1024,1024,1,"这是一张具有极强视觉张力和左右对称构图的史诗级概念艺术插画。画面被严格地从正中央一分为二，展现出绝对的物理与时间落差。\n\n【左半部分：绝对零度的未来科技】\n背景是暴风雪肆虐的废弃赛博朋克重工业冰原，巨大的冰川尖刺穿透了生锈的金属反应堆。前景站立着一台战损级的重型装甲机甲战士。机甲表面覆盖着厚厚的冰霜与积雪，深灰色的非反射涂层上有着清晰的划痕。机甲肩部和膝盖的复杂液压关节暴露在外，头部面罩亮起刺骨的冰蓝色冷光。空气中弥漫着冰冷的白雾。\n\n【右半部分：烈焰焚天的远古神话】\n背景是燃烧崩塌的古代东方木制神庙，天空中飘浮着巨大的火星，地面流淌着滚烫的熔岩。前景站立着一位极其空灵、面容清冷的古代中国仙女。她穿着由赤红色与暗金色交织的复杂丝绸汉服，丝绸材质极度轻盈，裙摆与长长的披帛在热浪中剧烈飞舞。她的周围环绕着金色的火粉、余烬与流光，皮肤映照出火焰的暖红色环境光。\n\n【画面正中央：跨维度的绝对隔离】\n在冰与火的物理交界线正中央，悬浮着一块高科技的透明全息投影屏幕（UI界面）。屏幕正中央用巨大、发光且极具科幻感的无衬线字体写着完美的中文“奇点”。在中文正下方，用较小但极其清晰的英文写着“LOCAL DEPLOYMENT”。\n全息屏幕的左半边边缘结着复杂的六角形冰晶，右半边边缘则正在被高温扭曲并带有火光反光。\n\n极度真实的电影级光影，8k分辨率。机甲绝不能带有任何丝绸或火焰特征，仙女绝不能带有任何机械或冰雪特征，特征绝对物理隔离。","",""],"widgets_values_named":{"latent_kind":"Boogu","output_lang":"中文 [ZH]","preset_mode":"无预设","three_view_text":"","aspect_ratio":"1:1","width":1024,"height":1024,"batch_size":1,"internal_prompt":"这是一张具有极强视觉张力和左右对称构图的史诗级概念艺术插画。画面被严格地从正中央一分为二，展现出绝对的物理与时间落差。\n\n【左半部分：绝对零度的未来科技】\n背景是暴风雪肆虐的废弃赛博朋克重工业冰原，巨大的冰川尖刺穿透了生锈的金属反应堆。前景站立着一台战损级的重型装甲机甲战士。机甲表面覆盖着厚厚的冰霜与积雪，深灰色的非反射涂层上有着清晰的划痕。机甲肩部和膝盖的复杂液压关节暴露在外，头部面罩亮起刺骨的冰蓝色冷光。空气中弥漫着冰冷的白雾。\n\n【右半部分：烈焰焚天的远古神话】\n背景是燃烧崩塌的古代东方木制神庙，天空中飘浮着巨大的火星，地面流淌着滚烫的熔岩。前景站立着一位极其空灵、面容清冷的古代中国仙女。她穿着由赤红色与暗金色交织的复杂丝绸汉服，丝绸材质极度轻盈，裙摆与长长的披帛在热浪中剧烈飞舞。她的周围环绕着金色的火粉、余烬与流光，皮肤映照出火焰的暖红色环境光。\n\n【画面正中央：跨维度的绝对隔离】\n在冰与火的物理交界线正中央，悬浮着一块高科技的透明全息投影屏幕（UI界面）。屏幕正中央用巨大、发光且极具科幻感的无衬线字体写着完美的中文“奇点”。在中文正下方，用较小但极其清晰的英文写着“LOCAL DEPLOYMENT”。\n全息屏幕的左半边边缘结着复杂的六角形冰晶，右半边边缘则正在被高温扭曲并带有火光反光。\n\n极度真实的电影级光影，8k分辨率。机甲绝不能带有任何丝绸或火焰特征，仙女绝不能带有任何机械或冰雪特征，特征绝对物理隔离。","manager_settings":"","xb_image_preset":""},"color":"#16727c","bgcolor":"#4F0074"},{"id":60,"type":"8a4b16ef-97d1-47ea-8442-9298d7d42623","pos":[950,4830],"size":[500,770],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"主模型","name":"unet_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"unet_name"},"link":null},{"label":"CLIP","name":"clip_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"clip_name"},"link":null},{"label":"VAE","name":"vae_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"vae_name"},"link":null},{"name":"lora_01","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"lora_01"},"link":null},{"name":"strength_01","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"strength_01"},"link":null},{"name":"lora_02","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"lora_02"},"link":null},{"name":"strength_02","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"strength_02"},"link":null},{"name":"lora_03","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"lora_03"},"link":null},{"name":"strength_03","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"strength_03"},"link":null},{"label":"加速方式","name":"preset","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"preset"},"link":null},{"label":"随机种","name":"seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"seed"},"link":null},{"label":"采样器","name":"sampler_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"sampler_name"},"link":null},{"label":"调度器","name":"scheduler","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"scheduler"},"link":null},{"label":"采样步数","name":"steps","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"